  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A PDC Cooperation between nine partners including non-profit organizations, universities as well as companies from Vietnam, Sweden, Estonia, Germany, and Poland. The ultimate goal of the project is to support Vietnam in solving the burning problems in improvement the level and availability of healthcare professionals in Danang, and more broadly in Vietnam.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett akt&#xF6;rssamverkansprojekt mellan nio partners inkl. enskilda organisationer, universitet samt f&#xF6;retag fr&#xE5;n Vietnam, Sverige, Estland, Tyskland och Polen. Det fr&#xE4;msta m&#xE5;let med projektet &#xE4;r att st&#xF6;dja Vietnam i f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttring av och tillg&#xE5;ng till sjukv&#xE5;rdspersonal i Danang, och &#xE4;ven i &#xF6;vriga Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
